{"4038110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Night:Zombie Attack", "steam_appid": 4038110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Last Night: Zombie Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has fallen. Streets once full of life now echo with the groans of the dead. You’re one of the last survivors, fighting to make it through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Night: Zombie Attack</i> is a fast-paced survival game where every bullet, every barricade, and every second counts. The hordes don’t stop coming, and daylight feels a lifetime away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night</strong>: Face endless waves of zombies that grow stronger, faster, and smarter the longer you hold out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong>: Scavenge weapons, ammo, and supplies to stay alive. Every resource matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your defense</strong>: Barricade doors, set traps, and turn the environment into your ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight together or solo</strong>: Take on the apocalypse alone or with friends in co-op mode (if included).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere that bites</strong>: Dark alleys, flickering neon, and the constant dread of being one step from the end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t save the world. You won’t stop the outbreak. The best you can do is survive until morning.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Last Night: Zombie Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has fallen. Streets once full of life now echo with the groans of the dead. You’re one of the last survivors, fighting to make it through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Night: Zombie Attack</i> is a fast-paced survival game where every bullet, every barricade, and every second counts. The hordes don’t stop coming, and daylight feels a lifetime away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night</strong>: Face endless waves of zombies that grow stronger, faster, and smarter the longer you hold out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong>: Scavenge weapons, ammo, and supplies to stay alive. Every resource matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your defense</strong>: Barricade doors, set traps, and turn the environment into your ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight together or solo</strong>: Take on the apocalypse alone or with friends in co-op mode (if included).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere that bites</strong>: Dark alleys, flickering neon, and the constant dread of being one step from the end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t save the world. You won’t stop the outbreak. The best you can do is survive until morning.</p>", "short_description": "The Last Night: Zombie Attack. The city has fallen. Streets once full of life now echo with the groans of the dead. You’re one of the last survivors, fighting to make it through the night. its a fast-paced survival game where every bullet, every barricade, and every second counts.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038110/fbefe4339e6838a5f8691d9e3904e3a102b7bc20/header.jpg?t=1782465109", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038110/9d728878209c3fd0f0b43b56e8b2f1a1603922b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782465109", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038110/9d728878209c3fd0f0b43b56e8b2f1a1603922b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782465109", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\